    "Nothing is downloaded until you choose to install. When an update is found the menu bar shows an Update button instead of interrupting with a dialog." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nothing is downloaded until you choose to install. When an update is found the menu bar shows an Update button instead of interrupting with a dialog."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "インストールを選ぶまで何もダウンロードされません。アップデートが見つかると、ダイアログで作業を中断せず、メニューバーに「アップデート」ボタンが表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你选择安装之前不会下载任何内容。发现更新时，菜单栏会显示「更新」按钮，而不会弹出对话框打断你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你選擇安裝之前不會下載任何內容。發現更新時，選單列會顯示「更新」按鈕，而不會彈出對話框打斷你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
