    },
    "Turn pointer and click input on or off for scene and web wallpapers." : {
      "comment" : "Global shortcut action description.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn pointer and click input on or off for scene and web wallpapers."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "シーンと Web 壁紙のポインタ入力とクリック入力のオン/オフを切り替えます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开关场景和网页壁纸的指针与点击输入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開關場景和網頁桌布的指標與點按輸入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn this on only for a wallpaper that makes your Mac run hot. Those render at a reduced internal resolution and Apple's MetalFX spatial scaler rebuilds the full-resolution image, which measurably lowers GPU power. On a light wallpaper the scaler costs more than it saves and can raise power instead — which is why this is off by default. Quality keeps most detail; Performance saves the most but can soften small text. Changing this reloads your wallpapers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn this on only for a wallpaper that makes your Mac run hot. Those render at a reduced internal resolution and Apple's MetalFX spatial scaler rebuilds the full-resolution image, which measurably lowers GPU power. On a light wallpaper the scaler costs more than it saves and can raise power instead — which is why this is off by default. Quality keeps most detail; Performance saves the most but can soften small text. Changing this reloads your wallpapers."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Macが熱くなる壁紙にだけオンにしてください。その場合は内部解像度を下げてレンダリングし、AppleのMetalFX空間スケーラーがフル解像度の画像を再構築するため、GPU電力を実測できるほど下げられます。軽い壁紙ではスケーラーの負荷が節約分を上回り、かえって電力が増えることがあります。既定でオフなのはそのためです。「品質」はディテールをほぼ維持し、「パフォーマンス」は最も節約できますが、小さな文字がぼやけることがあります。変更すると壁紙が再読み込みされます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只在某张壁纸让你的 Mac 发烫时才开启。那种壁纸会以更低的内部分辨率渲染,由 Apple 的 MetalFX 空间缩放器重建全分辨率画面,可实测地降低 GPU 功耗。而在轻量壁纸上,缩放器本身的开销大于它省下的,反而会让功耗上升 —— 这正是默认关闭的原因。「画质」保留大部分细节;「性能」最省资源,但小号文字可能变得柔和。更改会重新加载壁纸。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只在某張桌布讓你的 Mac 發燙時才開啟。那種桌布會以更低的內部解析度算繪,由 Apple 的 MetalFX 空間縮放器重建全解析度畫面,可實測地降低 GPU 功耗。而在輕量桌布上,縮放器本身的開銷大於它省下的,反而會讓功耗上升 —— 這正是預設關閉的原因。「品質」保留大部分細節;「效能」最省資源,但小字可能變得模糊。變更會重新載入桌布。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turned out to be a wallpaper; it's in your library" : {
